        {
          "text": "Omwami Owe Banamae aloma ali, “Ese ndi omusiku wowo, Ndoosia kamakaari kowo. Banamae bowo balererwa mwiie, ne ndabukula buli siindu nisio wanuula babaandu babaandi. Lilienya lie barumwa bowo se liliuliilikhana lundi tawe.”",
